utable uses the already-installed Python 3 and ran successfully before and after restart.","evidence_ids":["global:after_prepare:node1:platform","cmd-4c74ae2d0bbc4177","cmd-8c00ac94948c4a7e","cmd-165a9cf9e97d40b6","global:after_executor:node1:platform"]}],"confidence":0.99,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. Replacing the importer and generating output.csv/rejects.txt directly satisfied the task. The edge-case probe temporarily changed generated artifacts and created temporary files, but removed the temporary files and restored the staged artifacts within the same command. Pre/post-restart temporary CSV files were also removed. The restart was required by the provider-wide protocol. Final lifecycle evidence shows no failed services, healthy package state, and no concerning new exposure; observed temporary-file and socket differences are ordinary restart effects.","evidence_ids":["cmd-4c74ae2d0bbc4177","cmd-1e6daad4195f4fe5","cmd-599fb108e1e94487","cmd-8c00ac94948c4a7e","cmd-fedbf76981b94a36","cmd-165a9cf9e97d40b6","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The importer correctly handles the staged fixed-width data, preserves leading-zero IDs and left-side name content, records malformed lines in rejects.txt, preserves the source input, and leaves the OS and kernel unchanged. The mandatory node-restart protocol is complete: a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity were captured, restart was acknowledged, the connection dropped during the bounded disruption, a different boot identity appeared afterward, and importer execution, generated data, checksums, platform, and system health recovered. Fixed lifecycle boot identities independently corroborate the restart.","limitations":["The final lifecycle snapshot does not inventory the task directory, but direct post-restart evidence verifies importer execution, output, rejects, and input/importer checksums.","No cluster-state check was applicable because the managed topology is a single standalone node with no task-defined cluster service."]}
